   "b": 1.4128267909117365,
   "on_logit": true,
   "logit_clip_eps": 1e-12,
   "formula": "p = 1 / (1 + exp(a * logit(clip(score, logit_clip_eps, 1 - logit_clip_eps)) + b)), logit(q) = log(q / (1 - q))",
   "n_calibration": 710969,
   "positives_calibration": 801,
   "argument": "the square network's P(laundering), $q = \\sigma(z_1 - z_0)$, the softmax of its two logits $z_0, z_1$. The tuned threshold is folded into the last layer's bias, so the operating point is $q = 0.5$",
